    "body": "Sebastian Schmidt <notifications@github.com> writes:\r\n\r\n> You probably want to install a nerd font. What OS are you running?\r\n>>  ## Prerequisites\r\n>> A [Nerd Font](https://www.nerdfonts.com/) installed and enabled in your terminal (for example, try the [Fira Code Nerd Font](https://www.nerdfonts.com/font-downloads)\r\n\r\nBased on a previous experience\r\n(https://konubinix.eu/blog/posts/d502db8c-3408-4958-b84e-a2bbd7144549/)\r\nI concluded that the Nerd Font were not needed in starship, provided I\r\nhad a font dedicated to emojis, like NotoColorEmoji. So I did not even\r\nthink about looking into a Nerd Font to find the battery icons.\r\n\r\nMy bad. Sorry for the noise :-).\r\n\r\nEverything is ok now \r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1181438/109068910-c4263900-76f0-11eb-8390-0bb656ef0c53.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n-- \r\nKonubinix\r\nGPG Key    : 7439106A\r\nFingerprint: 5993 BE7A DA65 E2D9 06CE  5C36 75D2 3CED 7439 106A\r\n",
