    "body": "Sebastian Schmidt <notifications@github.com> writes:\n\n> No worries, I felt the same for a while, nerd fonts do pack a lot of unnecessary icons IMHO\n\nActually, I had the opposite feeling. I installed starship and fira code\nnerd font and still found out that the emojis did not show up. I took me\na while to understand that the nerd font don't have emojis (at least not\n0x01F40D) and I needed to also install an emoji font, like fonts noto\ncolor emoji.\n\nThis is the reason why I mistakenly thought that fira code\nnerd font would not have the battery emoji.\n\nI guess I will keep both to have a correct look and feel of starship.\n\nThank you for answering me. starship looks great now :-)\n\n-- \nKonubinix\nGPG Key    : 7439106A\nFingerprint: 5993 BE7A DA65 E2D9 06CE  5C36 75D2 3CED 7439 106A\n",
